    "core_function_as_pasted": "vec2 screenSign(vec2 ndc, vec2 ndcStep, vec2 depthStep, mat4 proj)\n{\n    vec2 raster = 2.0 * (gl_FragCoord.xy - uTDGeneral.viewport.xy) * uTDGeneral.viewport.zw - 1.0;\n    vec2 runs = vec2(abs(ndc.x + raster.x) < abs(ndc.x - raster.x) ? -1.0 : 1.0,\n                     abs(ndc.y + raster.y) < abs(ndc.y - raster.y) ? -1.0 : 1.0);\n    // Neighbouring pixel centres are 2 x viewport.zw apart in raster units;\n    // only a pixel exactly on a centre line comes within 0.5 x viewport.zw of 0.\n    vec2 useStep = step(abs(raster), 0.5 * uTDGeneral.viewport.zw) * step(depthStep, vec2(0.1));\n    runs = mix(runs, vec2(ndcStep.x < 0.0 ? -1.0 : 1.0, ndcStep.y < 0.0 ? -1.0 : 1.0), useStep);\n    vec2 orient = runs * vec2(proj[0][0] < 0.0 ? -1.0 : 1.0, proj[1][1] < 0.0 ? -1.0 : 1.0);\n    if (uMarch.w > 0.5) orient.y = -orient.y;  // Flip V flips the base UV and every vertical offset together\n    return orient;\n}\n",
    "reading": "0 wrong pixels in every row, both readouts, both forms; the rows are identical value for value. The multisampled silhouette pixels the family found on meshes do not occur here: the blobs' silhouette is computed per pixel inside the box faces, so only glass at the box's outline is partly covered (318 to 446 pixels per row in the cut poses), and none of it took the wrong sign."
  },
